{{!
    @template local_autograder/modules

    The activity types autograder may be switched on for: the ones that take the work of students and have a grade that a teacher
    gives. Chips filter the rows by whether Autograder is on; each row has the icon and colour of its purpose, what Autograder reads for it and a toggle that sits in a
    small form of its own, which local_autograder/modules submits the moment it is flipped.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lead - What the page lists.
    * intro - What switching a type off does, below the list.
    * label - The accessible name of the list.
    * filters - The chips: key (all, on or off), label, count and whether it is the active one.
    * search - The placeholder of the search box, empty when there are few types and no box.
    * empty - What to say when no row matches.
    * count - The number of types, in words.
    * types - One entry per activity type:
      * iconurl - The address of its icon, which Moodle draws on its course page.
      * purpose - The purpose that Moodle gives it, which names the colour of the icon.
      * name - Its name.
      * reads - What Autograder reads for it.
      * ison - Whether Autograder is on for it.
      * action - Where its form is posted.
      * params - The form's hidden inputs, each a name and a value.
      * toggle - Its switch, already rendered by core/toggle.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lead": "The activity types that take the work of students and have a grade that a teacher gives",
        "intro": "Disabling a type hides the Autograder settings of its activities.",
        "label": "Activity types",
        "filters": [
            {"key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 2, "active": true},
            {"key": "on", "label": "On", "count": 1, "active": false},
            {"key": "off", "label": "Off", "count": 1, "active": false}
        ],
        "search": "",
        "empty": "No activity type matches.",
        "count": "2 activity types",
        "types": [
            {
                "iconurl": "https://example.com/mod/assign/pix/monologo.svg",
                "purpose": "assessment",
                "name": "Assignment",
                "reads": "Reads the hand-ins of students",
                "ison": true,
                "action": "https://example.com/local/autograder/modules.php",
                "params": [
                    {"name": "modname", "value": "assign"},
                    {"name": "enabled", "value": "0"},
                    {"name": "sesskey", "value": "abcdef1234"}
                ],
                "toggle": "<div class=\"custom-control custom-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-control-input\" id=\"local-autograder-toggle-assign\" data-submitonchange=\"1\" checked><label class=\"custom-control-label\" for=\"local-autograder-toggle-assign\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Disable Autograder for Assignment</span></label></div>"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="lag" id="local-autograder-modules">
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">{{lead}}</p>
    <div class="dd-chips" role="group" aria-label="{{label}}">
        {{#filters}}
        <button type="button" class="dd-chip" data-filter="{{key}}" aria-pressed="{{#active}}true{{/active}}{{^active}}false{{/active}}">
            {{label}} <span class="dd-chip-count" data-count="{{key}}">{{count}}</span>
        </button>
        {{/filters}}
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        {{#search}}
        <div class="table-toolbar">
            <div class="input-group">
                <label class="sr-only visually-hidden" for="local-autograder-search">{{search}}</label>
                <input type="search" class="form-control" id="local-autograder-search" data-region="search" placeholder="{{search}}…">
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/search}}
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table">
                <caption class="sr-only visually-hidden">{{label}}</caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}modules:name, local_autograder{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}modules:reads, local_autograder{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-right text-end">{{#str}}modules:state, local_autograder{{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#types}}
                    <tr data-state="{{#ison}}on{{/ison}}{{^ison}}off{{/ison}}" data-name="{{name}}">
                        <td>
                            <span class="lag-type-name">
                                <span class="activityiconcontainer {{purpose}}"><img class="activityicon" src="{{iconurl}}" alt="" width="24" height="24"></span>
                                <strong>{{name}}</strong>
                            </span>
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-muted">{{reads}}</td>
                        <td class="text-right text-end">
                            <form method="post" action="{{action}}">
                                {{#params}}
                                <input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">
                                {{/params}}
                                {{{toggle}}}
                            </form>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/types}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <p class="text-center text-muted p-5 mb-0" data-region="empty" role="status" hidden>{{empty}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-foot text-muted small">{{count}}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="small text-muted mb-0">{{intro}}</p>
</div>
